                        href="/vet-register" style="color: #393f81;">Register here</a></p>
                       
                        <div class="form-outline"  >
            <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary me-1" onclick="window.location.href = '/front';">
              <span>Selet Role</span>
              <i class="fas fa-user-shield icon"></i>
            </button>
          </div>
         
                    <a href="#!" class="small text-muted">PETSYNC.</a>
